Package: buildCEGs
Type: Package
Title: Constructing, Manipulating and Analysing Chain Event Graph Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Kieran", "Drury",
      email = "kieran.drury@warwick.ac.uk",
      role = c("aut", "cre","cph"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-7153-2710")
    )
  )
Description: Enables the user to manually build event trees, staged trees and 
    chain event graphs, and to perform graph operations 
    and probabilistic analyses on these models. The package is designed primarily 
    to aid the development of expert-elicited chain event graphs, allowing users 
    to construct and manipulate graphical models rather than relying on data-driven
    algorithms.
